+## Complete 39 selected statement records
+
+Each Execution has exactly semantics/action/pre/post/steps/effects. Each Step has exactly index/statement/value/snapshot/effects. Statement is the complete selected public DTO, including alias strings and numeric expression root. Financial Step.value is the typed evaluated UInt amount; discharge reports the reduction, not the closing duty. Let reports captured typed RHS; guards/ensures report typed Booltrue. Next/Emit report their typed RHS. None of these completed kinds reports null or omits value.
