+## Work and envelopes
+
+The existing public logical profile charges one dispatch plus each uncached expression node, resetting cache each statement; both boolean operands are evaluated eagerly. Invoice node counts3,3,5,1,1,1,1,3,3,3,5,1 give increments **4,4,6,2,2,2,2,4,4,4,6,2**, total42 for each call and84 sequentially. Reserve node counts4,3,3,5,3,1,1,1,1,1,1,1,1,3,1 give **5,4,4,6,4,2,2,2,2,2,2,2,2,4,2**, total45. Prior independent work tables agree. Uninvoked registration costs4/6 are not charged. These are adopted public schedule consequences under the declared arena premises, not conditional Core/2 draft work or host timing. Successful attempted/committed primitive work is42/42/45 respectively; each positive cap equals its total. Ordinary reports contain no cost fields.
