+The three ordinary envelopes contain exactly status accepted, qualification local-reference-execution, execution. Three cap42/cap42/cap45 envelopes add exactly profile moriarty-reference-logical-cost/1 and logical {cap,used}, canonical decimal strings. Their entire Execution is identical to its ordinary counterpart. CASES.json lists exactly six argv templates, expected exit0, empty stderr and whole stdout files. No trace/target/signed/native mode, file writer, authenticated continuation or report aggregate is implied.
