+
+The authority for the formerly missing Let field is the explicit desired public contract selected in `adopted-contract/DESIGN-ADOPTION.json`, after the two recorded independent design votes. The three exact proposal documents retain their original source-time PROPOSED/UNADOPTED status; the later adoption record supplies their current selection. They have not been rewritten. Their source author inspected implementation and disclosed that exposure. This custodian read the adopted proposal/source note, including its source-observation descriptions. No claim of preimplementation derivation or blinding is made. The custodian did not inspect changed candidate/parser/evaluator/exporter bodies or actual outputs for this task, and no product implementation or formatter generated the goldens.
+
+Moriarty development startup/status was restored. All files written are confined to this outside-Git directory. Only plain Python JSON/literal arithmetic, copy and hash operations assembled/checked data. No Cargo/rustc/rustfmt, Moriarty parser/evaluator/exporter/compiler, model, SDK/VM/proof, wallet/key/config/private/cache/provider/network or Git mutation action occurred. No rejection/security case or resource/security judgment is supplied. The consumer-test author remains separate and must receive this freeze before using it.
