+## Scope, files and process expectations
+
+`CASES.json` lists exactly five positive calls: Counter ordinary, cap16, cap-u128-max; empty action ordinary, cap0. Each expects exit0, exactly the bytes in its complete `*.stdout.json` and zero stderr bytes from `empty.stderr.expected.bin`. The argv template selects `mori --color never simulate`, the supplied source/scenario, selected action and optional logical cap. No target, trace, signed/sponsor/native or staged arguments belong to these cases.
