+`counter.execution.expected.json` and `empty.execution.expected.json` contain complete standalone Execution JSON values for structural comparison. Each stdout file contains its full accepted public envelope and independently serialized final LF. Full JSON equality and exact complete stdout-byte equality are separate predicates. `FINANCIAL-AND-WORK.json` retains all state snapshots, per-Step deltas, derived cumulative prefixes, exact logical units and complete financial projections. `INVENTORY.json` records every payload's SHA-256, byte size and provenance; `FREEZE.sha256` binds all payloads including that inventory, excluding itself.
