+## Counter: exact unchanged source and independent arithmetic
+
+The 212-byte `counter.mori` and raw `counter-amount7.scenario.json` are copied exactly from the prior partial-facts packet. The source hash remains `8e89db83018345a771224e3b20218eb06eb905562d4d3bc5f239b3aff41f07b0`. Source/scenario bytes, previous incomplete facts and twelve existing compatibility tests are untouched.
