+No Counter financial asset, balance, fee or duty is declared/supplied. Monetary projections are inapplicable, not funded zero-cost settlement. This packet independently selects the complete expected report from source arithmetic and the adopted contract; it no longer calls an evaluator to supply the full execution as the existing compatibility test does.
