+For N=0, the adopted contract sets steps=[], post=pre, effects=[] and no synthetic Step. Thus count5, ready=true, balances11/23/97 and present duty17 survive exactly. CASH total11+23+97=131 before and after; each account's gross debit, fee and net balance change is0. Duty opening17+created0+accrued0−discharged0=closing17, present throughout. The positive residual financial obligation17 remains; completion of idle does not settle it. Treasury97 is preserved, but no automatic pledge or authenticated funding is inferred from its name. No mint, burn, refund or rounding occurs; rounding dust0 does not label the unspent treasury balance as dust.
