+This is a finite expected public-byte representation for these five specimens, separate from semantic JSON equality. It is not a universal cross-language serializer proof or a rule that object member order defines semantics. The adopted contract preserves existing pretty/export compatibility and requires exact byte oracles to be checked separately. An actual mismatch must be preserved and reviewed; it cannot silently rewrite these files. Standalone Execution files are structural values; their standalone indentation is not an asserted embedded-subtree byte slice.
